Free for any team to use. Each title links to the resource.

## [Scouting](https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTDu3dDTkE99Br2O2hQOanu8J4jSmu1JGO9Wu16bPszviQHBghalKMByZ7b3rZ8ORzjTC-xYXdBbLAH/pub)

This is our list of public scouting resources. Scouting is the process of gathering data from matches from teams at events to make data-based decisions on alliance selection ahead of time.

## [Business and Marketing Handbook](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cNefMx6omf2roQdGfgVj79yLoH6rzJ4LU-AU7mNMxHM/edit?tab=t.0)

For new robotics teams, the Spartronics Business and Marketing Handbook serves as a potential example for establishing a professional team and sustainable funding.

